-- Float32 elaborates fine now (Kind inference: semantics step, DONE) — but
-- solver/codegen support isn't implemented yet (see docs/design-decisions.md's
-- `Float32`/`FiniteFloat32` section), so `solver::check_file`'s upstream gate
-- rejects this cleanly before the solver or codegen ever run.
main : -> Float32
main() = 3.14f
